          <span class="text-white text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight block leading-none">SCIENCE WITH GAYUM</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-cyan-400 font-medium">විද්‍යාව සරලව</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav class="hidden md:flex">
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="index.html" class="nav-link">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="classes.html" class="nav-link">Classes</a></li>
