            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">O/L Target Model Paper 01</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">අනුමාන ප්‍රශ්න පත්‍රය 01 - Structured essay and MCQ question set with answers.</p>
          </div>
